# Aethelred Wallet — CODEOWNERS
#
# Every line matches a path pattern and requires review from the
# listed owners before the file can change. Owners are GitHub
# handles (`@username`) or team slugs (`@org/team`).
#
# Ordering: the LAST matching pattern wins, so more-specific
# patterns should appear LOWER in the file. The catch-all at the
# top (`*`) is the default reviewer for any path that isn't
# matched more specifically.
#
# Future handles (iOS lead, Android lead) are placeholders — add
# the real handles when those roles are filled. Until then the
# repo owner is the sole required reviewer for those paths.

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Default owner (fallback for any unmatched file)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*   @ramtamilselvan

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Security-critical wallet packages
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `core` holds key material, signing, EIP-712, RLP, custody.
/packages/core/**           @ramtamilselvan
# `audit` is the tamper-evident event log — any change MUST be
# reviewed by the repo owner.
/packages/audit/**          @ramtamilselvan
# `credentials` handles WebAuthn / passkey enrollment and the
# §6.1.1 clone detector.
/packages/credentials/**    @ramtamilselvan

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Platform-specific app code (mobile + extension)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# iOS future: add `@aethelred/ios-lead` once hired.
/apps/ios/**                @ramtamilselvan
# Android future: add `@aethelred/android-lead` once hired.
/apps/android/**            @ramtamilselvan

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Compliance and security policy documents
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/docs/compliance/**         @ramtamilselvan
/docs/security/**           @ramtamilselvan
/.github/SECURITY.md        @ramtamilselvan

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CI / build / release surface
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Any change to workflows, Dependabot config, or CODEOWNERS
# itself routes to the repo owner.
/.github/workflows/**       @ramtamilselvan
/.github/dependabot.yml     @ramtamilselvan
/.github/CODEOWNERS         @ramtamilselvan
/.github/allowed-licenses.json  @ramtamilselvan
/.semgrep/**                @ramtamilselvan
/.trufflehog/**             @ramtamilselvan
